<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 137 0 R
/T (Why it matters for this paper: this study isn't database-specific -its relevance is conceptual. It supplies large-scale empirical evidence for the integrity dimension of the CIA Triad, complementing \(not extending\) the narrower, database-specific findings from Study 1. Because prior ransomware research was often limited to a handful of samples, this scale finally allows detection strategies that generalize across the ransomware ecosystem, instead of being tuned to one soon-outdated variant.)
/E (Why it matters for this paper: this study isn't database-specific -its relevance is conceptual. It supplies large-scale empirical evidence for the integrity dimension of the CIA Triad, complementing \(not extending\) the narrower, database-specific findings from Study 1. Because prior ransomware research was often limited to a handful of samples, this scale finally allows detection strategies that generalize across the ransomware ecosystem, instead of being tuned to one soon-outdated variant.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
