990 0 obj
<<
/Title (Why it matters for this paper: this study isn't database-specific -its relevance is conceptual. It supplies large-scale empirical evidence for the integrity dimension of the CIA Triad, complementing \(not extending\) the narrower, database-specific findings from Study 1. Because prior ransomware research was often limited to a handful of samples, this scale finally allows detection strategies that generalize across the ransomware ecosystem, instead of being tuned to one soon-outdated variant.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 977 0 R
/Next 991 0 R
>>
endobj
