<<
/Title (Core idea: instead of measuring statistical randomness \(entropy / chi-squared\), FAV checks whether a file's content still obeys its own format's structural rules \(e.g. a .docx's internal ZIP/XML container\). Even a small amount of encryption breaks those rules -making fine-grained, evasive partial encryption reliably detectable.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 979 0 R
/Next 996 0 R
>>
