<<
/Title (Because these attacks delete data rather than encrypt it, recovery is only possible if the attacker actually exfiltrated a copy -and is willing to return it. Honeypot data was only ever partially exfiltrated \(or not at all\), and multiple real-world victims paid but never got their data back.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1025 0 R
>>
